<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">William IV of Forcalquier</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1209">1209</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/12th-century">12th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">William IV was the last independent Count of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/forcalquier">Forcalquier</a> in Provence. In 1193 his granddaughter Garsenda married Alfonso II of Provence, and on William's death in 1209 Forcalquier was reunited with the County of Provence under the house of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/barcelona">Barcelona</a>.</p></div>
